h rendered-button mouse clicks and verify initial state, one-at-a-time append behavior, fourth-generated clearing, exact finished text, and visible white border.\n\n## Goal-size exception\n\n§ 10.1\n<required only when this goal has one permitted work unit>\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
